paragraph\" >\u2705 A cast of charming characters with increasing difficulty levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Story mode + free battles to test your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an addictive and spicy experience where strategy and creativity are your best weapons. Do you have what it takes to win and &quot;dominate&quot; this battle? \ud83d\ude0f\ud83d\udd25</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Soph","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602090/7f3e80b07bf307902c65e8414dc7bfbccf5ba506.jpg"},{"name":"Elara","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602090/a27256363ec6891f8163e7b22309baae0cc4ab62.jpg"},{"name":"Liora","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602090/b35068adbe9bae2829ba41eaae7682a0d77effd6.jpg"},{"name":"Seraphina","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602090/38d93c85da422c06a9ac3556d3de25e7d083a09c.jpg"},{"name":"Isolde","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602090/68406478fd1d22859dcba7936e89019475ed85fd.jpg"},{"name":"Thalia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602090/4e5958b0541258ab7b6f4208cc551ddc9f066c0a.jpg"},{"name":"Vivienne","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602090/25f344f4f3b13e15e54d2bf545b698a69c39f75a.jpg"},{"name":"Aurora","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602090/1d596223e9b17fb41c34fd509040685052ba0bc4.jpg"},{"name":"Celestia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602090/9b6e90a5f16b80326ba678de6baf6b7cdfacd507.jpg"},{"name":"Mirabel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602090/3b26f57a5f6b02cc81319f63bda2806198734598.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/sto